<!-- ID: recommendations -->
## Recommendations

1. Route a surgical P1 repair package. Do not replace the telemetry system.
2. Thread a tool execution-start timestamp or precomputed full tool duration from actual tool call sites into the existing formatter/logging boundary.
3. Repair the `set_project` doc-generation FileNotFoundError found by the plan-named test command.
4. Repair or explain the SQLite `status` schema mismatch so the fresh readback probe can run cleanly.
5. Rerun the focused persistence suite, the plan-named suite, and a fresh readback probe after the repair.
6. Do not route P2, P5, P6, or P7 until P1 receives package-specific Crucible PASS.

